          508.0
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "M) But the rising interest in forgotten foods in some quarters is overtaken by the global spread of Western-style diets heavy in sugar, fat and processed foods in others.",
      "block_bbox": [
        67,
        515,
